{%- comment -%}
  HojichaYa chat widget loader.

  Install:
  1. In the Shopify admin: Online Store → Themes → ⋯ → Edit code.
  2. Under "Snippets" click "Add a new snippet", name it `hojichaya-chat`, and paste
     this file's contents.
  3. Open `layout/theme.liquid` and add this line just before the closing </body> tag:
        {% render 'hojichaya-chat' %}
  4. Replace BACKEND_URL below with your deployed chatbot URL (see this folder's README).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign backend_url = 'https://YOUR-CHATBOT-URL.example.com' -%}

<script>
  window.HOJICHAYA_CHAT = {
    backendUrl: {{ backend_url | json }},
    greeting: "Hi! 🍵 I'm the HojichaYa assistant. Ask me about our teas, shipping, brewing, or wholesale."
  };
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ backend_url }}/widget.css">
<script src="{{ backend_url }}/widget.js" defer></script>
